Subject: [PATCH 3/6] tu: Expose VK_EXT_post_depth_coverage

ir3 already forwards ExecutionModePostDepthCoverage to
RB_PS_INPUT_CNTL.POSTDEPTHCOVERAGE (tu6_emit_fs_inputs), the same bit
the gallium driver uses for GL_ARB_post_depth_coverage.

Generated-by: LLM
